  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conservation of the Mid-19th-Century Pipe Organ Pipe Organ at the Franciscan Monastery of St. John the Baptist in Kraljeva Sutjeska</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The pipe organ in the Franciscan Monastery of St. John the Baptist in Kraljeva Sutjeska endures as a tangible reminder of the area&apos;s musical heritage and historical traditions. This project aims to restore and preserve the pipe organ, engage the community, and provide educational opportunities about its history and craftsmanship. Activities include documenting the current state of the organ, consulting with experts, conducting restoration work, organizing workshops and field trips, and hosting a concert to showcase the restored organ.</narrative>
  </description>
